cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Neu ban su dung repository nay trong nghien cuu hoac hoc tap, vui long
  trich dan phan mo rong TA-ACRF-RNN theo thong tin ben duoi, VA trich dan
  bai bao nen ACRF-RNN (xem muc "references" ben duoi hoac preferred-citation).
title: >-
  TA-ACRF-RNN: Distributed Graph-Based Financial Fraud Detection
  with Time-Aware Attention-based CRF and NebulaGraph
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-05"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NganNT357/ta-acrf-rnn-fraud-detection"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Nguyen"
    given-names: "Tran Thao Nguyen"
    affiliation: "University of Information Technology, VNU-HCM"
  - family-names: "Nguyen"
    given-names: "Thuy Ngan"
    affiliation: "University of Information Technology, VNU-HCM"
keywords:
  - financial fraud detection
  - graph neural network
  - attention mechanism
  - conditional random field
  - distributed database
  - PostgreSQL
  - NebulaGraph
  - Apache Spark
abstract: >-
  Do an mo rong mo hinh nen ACRF-RNN (IJCAI 2025) thanh TA-ACRF-RNN bang co
  che time-aware relation, ket hop voi tang du lieu phan tan PostgreSQL va
  NebulaGraph de luu tru, truy van va giai thich quan he rui ro giua cac
  cong ty trong bai toan phat hien gian lan bao cao tai chinh. Day la do
  an mon Du lieu lon (IS405), Khoa He thong Thong tin, Truong Dai hoc Cong
  nghe Thong tin, DHQG-HCM.
references:
  - type: conference-paper
    title: "Attention-based Conditional Random Field for Financial Fraud Detection"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Wang"
        given-names: "Xiaoguang"
      - family-names: "Wang"
        given-names: "Chenxu"
      - family-names: "Zhang"
        given-names: "Luyue"
      - family-names: "Wang"
        given-names: "Xiaole"
      - family-names: "Wang"
        given-names: "Mengqin"
    collection-title: "Proceedings of the Thirty-Fourth International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI-25)"
    year: 2025
    doi: "10.24963/ijcai.2025/870"
    url: "https://www.ijcai.org/proceedings/2025/870"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/XNetLab/ACRF-RNN"
    notes: >-
      Bai bao nen (base paper) ma repository nay tai hien (reproduce) va
      mo rong (extend) thanh TA-ACRF-RNN. Vui long tham khao va tuan thu
      dieu khoan cap phep rieng cua repository goc XNetLab/ACRF-RNN doi voi
      ma nguon va du lieu cua ho.
